00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:26,000
You're either S.W.A.T. or you're not.

2
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:46,000
S.W.A.T. is a action, thriller, crime film directed by Clark Johnson.

3
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Hondo Harrelson recruits Jim Street to join an elite
unit of the Los Angeles Police Department.

4
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:26,000
Together they seek out more members, including tough
Deke Kay and single mom Chris Sanchez.

5
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:46,000
The team's first big assignment is to escort crime boss Alex Montel to prison.

6
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
It seems routine, but when Montel offers a huge reward to anyone who can break
him free, criminals of various stripes step up for the prize.

7
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:26,000
Sgt. Dan 'Hondo' Harrelson, played by Samuel L. Jackson.

8
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:46,000
Jim Street, played by Colin Farrell.

9
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:06,000
Chris Sanchez, played by Michelle Rodriguez.

10
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:26,000
Deacon 'Deke' Kaye, played by LL Cool J.

11
00:47:40,000 --> 00:47:46,000
T.J. McCabe, played by Josh Charles.

12
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
